     remember, not an explanation. "dinner." carries the cobalt the way
     "arriving." does in the headline opposite: an accent on the word the
     sentence turns on, which on this page already appears in a line that
     is plainly not a link. Nothing here is a control — no arrow, no
     hover, no pointer, no focus.

